	"data": "Reflection: December 8, 2025 — \"Everything Was About to Land\"\n\nThe Journal\n\nA 15-minute voice journal recorded on the drive to BSU. December 8th. cithoreal is in the car, heading to work on a final with Katie, talking through his todo list: 3D modeling Katie's crochet hook, trying Open Brush for mixed reality, Christmas shopping, and — the meat of it — the LLM processing center.\n\nHe describes a system that does \"document in, document out.\" New documents get processed, added to vectors. He's…",
